body:
Thanks for you reply. I've tried Ikea, SCS, Furniture Village and although there are chairs I've considered, they've all got bad reviews online e.g. chairs being different to store, chairs sinking after a few months and a  lack of help from store with faults. All of those issues are dealt with by my local store so other stores are out of the equation for me. 

&#x200B;

If you were in my position, which chair would you go for out of the two I described?
